==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|οἴφω}}, {{cog|sa|यभति}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sh|/jěbati/}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|je|ba|ti}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=jèbati|a=impf}}

# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{ux|sh|jebao sam je c(ij)elo ljeto/leto|t=I was fucking her for the whole summer|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|jebao sam je divlje u guzu sve do zore|t=I kept fucking her in the ass until dawn|inline=1}}
